{"Version":2,"ProgramText":"; Create a raster bar for the background\nRASTER 3, 0, 0, 480, \"DarkBlue, Blue, Cyan, White, DarkBlue\"\n\n; Turn on wrap (the bar now continues past the edges of the screen)\nRASTER WRAP 3, 1 \n\n; Move it down - when it leaves the screen it comes back at the top!\ny = 0\nWhile 1\n    RASTER MOVE 3, y\n    y = y - 2\n    IF y = -480 THEN y = 0  ; Reset for a smooth loop\n    WAIT VBL\nWend","ScreenWidth":null,"ScreenHeight":null,"Sprites":null,"MapWidth":null,"MapHeight":null,"MapData":null}